Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='constructivemodel', at=datetime(2026, 11, 26, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='Model data constructively: valid by construction, total functions, exhaustive matches', body='Define valid values by a type that cannot hold a bad state, and parse once at the boundary. Choose the representation that makes the logic simple, and convert at the edges. Write total functions with no panic or error arm for an impossible state. Match our own sum types exhaustively with no wildcard arm, so a new case forces every consumer to change. Wrap a value in a type only if code inspects it.', rationale='Types that carry the obligations make a class of bugs impossible, and a wrapper nobody inspects only adds code.', supersedes=()))